# API base path. Leave UNSET so requests go to the same origin (e.g. http://localhost:5174/api/v1)
# and Vite proxies `/api` → your backend — avoids CORS during local dev.
# Only set an absolute URL if you intentionally call the API on another host (then configure CORS on the server).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
